---
// ¿Qué es SportDharma Ecosystem?
---

<section class="py-24 px-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-black via-slate-900 to-black transition-colors duration-300">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <p class="text-[#E8530E] font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">DESCUBRÍ</p>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white">
        ¿Qué es <span class="text-[#E8530E]">SportDharma Ecosystem</span>?
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-justify">
          <strong class="text-white">SportDharma Ecosystem</strong> es una plataforma integral de software libre diseñada para caminantes, senderistas, cicloviajeros y deportistas de aventura, y para equipos de primera respuesta, con prioridad radical por comunidades aisladas y territorios sin conectividad.
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-justify">El ecosistema consta de tres componentes interconectados:</p>
          <div class="space-y-3 pl-2">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#E8530E]/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#E8530E]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 18h.01M8 21h8a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H8a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <span class="text-lg text-gray-300"><strong class="text-white">App móvil</strong> para seguimiento offline</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#E8530E]/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#E8530E]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.657 0 3-4.03 3-9s-1.343-9-3-9m0 18c-1.657 0-3-4.03-3-9s1.343-9 3-9m-9 9a9 9 0 019-9"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <span class="text-lg text-gray-300"><strong class="text-white">Página Web</strong> con contenido curado</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#E8530E]/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#E8530E]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <span class="text-lg text-gray-300"><strong class="text-white">Arquitectura MASF</strong> para curación humana asistida por IA</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-justify">
          Combina <strong class="text-white">nueve pilares fundamentales</strong> que garantizan privacidad total, funcionamiento offline, y una arquitectura local-first.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-4">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#E8530E]/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#E8530E]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></div><span class="text-white font-medium">100% Código abierto</span></div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#E8530E]/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#E8530E]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></div><span class="text-white font-medium">Funciona offline</span></div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#E8530E]/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#E8530E]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></div><span class="text-white font-medium">Sin trackers</span></div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#E8530E]/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#E8530E]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></div><span class="text-white font-medium">Multi-idioma</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm p-8">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between items-start gap-4">
            <div class="bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm text-center flex-1 min-w-[80px]"><svg class="w-10 h-10 text-[#E8530E] mx-auto mb-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 19l9 2-9-18-9 18 9-2zm0 0v-8"></path></svg><p class="text-xs text-gray-300 font-medium">Rutas</p></div>
            <div class="bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm text-center flex-1 min-w-[80px]"><svg class="w-10 h-10 text-[#E8530E] mx-auto mb-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg><p class="text-xs text-gray-300 font-medium">Energía</p></div>
            <div class="bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm text-center flex-1 min-w-[80px]"><svg class="w-10 h-10 text-[#E8530E] mx-auto mb-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"></path></svg><p class="text-xs text-gray-300 font-medium">Comunidad</p></div>
            <div class="bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm text-center flex-1 min-w-[80px]"><svg class="w-10 h-10 text-[#E8530E] mx-auto mb-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path></svg><p class="text-xs text-gray-300 font-medium">Privacidad</p></div>
            <div class="bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm text-center flex-1 min-w-[80px]"><svg class="w-10 h-10 text-[#E8530E] mx-auto mb-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg><p class="text-xs text-gray-300 font-medium">Global</p></div>
            <div class="bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm text-center flex-1 min-w-[80px]"><svg class="w-10 h-10 text-[#E8530E] mx-auto mb-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"></path></svg><p class="text-xs text-gray-300 font-medium">Open Source</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm">
          <img src="/masf-captura-v2.png" alt="Interfaz del sistema MASF" class="w-full h-auto object-cover transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-[1.02]" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
